  :question/id #uuid "9b9a3d0a-810d-5b88-b463-1c01291bca52"
  :question/problem "Source question: Canvas Question 9, ID 59547969; submitted attempt 1.\n\nThe matrix $A=\\begin{bmatrix}2&1&3&4\\\\-3&-2&4&-3\\\\1&2&1&2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2&1\\\\1&-3\\\\-2&2\\\\2&-1\\end{bmatrix}$ is the product of two matrices. What is the 1,1 element $a_{11}$ of $A$?\n\n$a_{11}=$ {{answer}}."
  :question/answer-fields ["d8af8e6b-656d-591a-b206-1353eee585c5"]
  :question/worked-solution "Use row 1 and column 1: $2(2)+1(1)+3(-2)+4(2)=4+1-6+8=7$.\n\nHistorical Canvas result: 4/4 points, submitted 2026-10-16 at 22:45 PDT."
  :db/ensure :question/validate}
