  :question/worked-solution "The first operation is left multiplication by $E_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1&0&0\\\\3&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{bmatrix}$, and the second by $E_2=\\begin{bmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&1&0\\\\1&0&0\\end{bmatrix}$. Thus the result is $E_2E_1A$, so $M=E_2E_1$. The factor for the last operation is on the left.\n\nHistorical Canvas result: 4/4 points, submitted 2026-10-30 at 23:11 PDT."
  :db/ensure :question/validate}
