{:db/id "fc3dc2e6-ca01-5954-9f4e-495bfbed608e"
  :question/id #uuid "fc3dc2e6-ca01-5954-9f4e-495bfbed608e"
  :question/problem "Source question: Canvas Question 3, ID 59595348; submitted attempt 1.\n\nCompute the determinant of $A=\\begin{bmatrix}1&3&0&-1\\\\0&2&0&0\\\\-1&2&-1&3\\\\-3&2&0&-2\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\n$\\det(A)=$ {{answer}}."
  :question/answer-fields ["46e35f3e-f158-5f08-8140-0dec6f0b314b"]
  :question/worked-solution "Expand along column 3, whose only nonzero entry is $a_{33}=-1$: $$\\det A=-\\det\\begin{bmatrix}1&3&-1\\\\0&2&0\\\\-3&2&-2\\end{bmatrix}=-2\\det\\begin{bmatrix}1&-1\\\\-3&-2\\end{bmatrix}=-2(-2-3)=10.$$\n\nHistorical Canvas result: 6/6 points, submitted 2026-10-30 at 23:11 PDT."
  :db/ensure :question/validate}
