  :answer/id #uuid "7ce7a565-19b3-5cd9-9cce-44297f17dc6d"
  :answer/type :answer.type/text
  :answer/value "$t=0$. Expanding along column 1 gives $$\\det A=e^t(t^2-2t^2)=-e^tt^2.$$ Since $e^t>0$ for real $t$, the determinant vanishes exactly at $t=0$."
